> Conclusion

All forward predictions remain unchanged while the visualization signal changes. Exact sign/zero checks expose a nonlinear modified backward rule;real-image target and weight controls assess dependence without turning the guided signal into an ordinary derivative or causal explanation.

> References

- [Springenberg et al.(2014/2015),Striving for Simplicity:The All Convolutional Net](https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6806).
- [Simonyan et al.(2013/2014),Deep Inside Convolutional Networks](https://arxiv.org/abs/1312.6034).
